it all begins with a few rough pencil  sketches and ends up a quaint living  room or a giant City the art director  draws on imagination and research to  bring to the big screen visions of what  is and what could be these are the five  films that have been nominated for this  year for art direction the power of  television journalism in the 50s in the  climate of fear created by Senator  Joseph McCarthy was the backdrop for the  art direction of nominee Jim Bissell and  the set decoration of nominee Jan  Pascale and good night and good luck it  was back to Hogwarts for young Harry  Potter as he and his companions found  themselves in the magical often  frightening art direction of nominees  Stewart Craig and the set decoration of  Stephanie McMillan in Harry Potter and  the Goblet of Fire the mighty king Colin  was able to roam the jungles of Skull  Island and the depression-era streets of  New York thanks to the art direction of  nominee grant major the set decoration  of nominees Dan henna and Simon bright  the final days of the golden era of  Japanese geishas were meticulously  recreated in the art direction of John  Mayer and the set decoration of Gretchen  Rao for Memoirs of a Geisha  jane austen's account of love and  misunderstanding in eighteenth-century  rural England is succinctly captured by  the art direction of nominee Sarah  Greenwood and the set decoration of  nominee Katie Spencer in Pride and  Prejudice and the Oscar goes to John  Mayer for Memoirs of a Geisha and for  set decoration gretchen Rao  this is the second Academy Award and  third nomination for John Mayer the  first Australian and second nomination  for Gretchen Rahul  well thank you very very much oh I'm  really lucky to share this award tonight  with a really lovely lovely woman our  set decorator Gretchen rau who  unfortunately couldn't be with us here  tonight and she asked me to read a  little note Gretchen wishes she could be  here with all of you she thanks everyone  with whom she's collaborated in her work  and her life she loves you all  Gretchen our thoughts and prayers are  with you tonight  I'm sure Gretchen would also like to  thank our brilliant director Rob  Marshall because this really is his  movie every single frame of it so thank  you for letting us be a part of it and I  want to thank my team my whole crew but  that led by the team of Tomas Roth John  Hoskins clyde zimmerman thank you very  much and thank you to my agent Sandra  Marsh who got me here thank you
 

